| Route | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `GET /` | Main IntelliFix web studio |
| `GET /suite-report` | Benchmark & suite evaluation report view |
| `GET /analytics` | Eco & telemetry analytics dashboard |
| `GET /api/files` | List available sample, benchmark, and fixed files |
| `GET /api/source?filename=...` | Read an allowed source file |
| `POST /api/file` | Read an allowed file (used by the web UI) |
| `POST /api/analyze` | Security scan, diagnose, explain, and synthesize fixes (JSON or SSE stream) |
| `POST /api/analyze/stream` | Explicit SSE streaming analysis endpoint |
| `POST /api/apply-patch` | Apply a single diagnostic card patch via LibCST (with line fallback) |
| `POST /api/agentic-compile` | Run the multi-agent compile-and-harden coordinator |
| `POST /api/security-metrics` | Run the 52-metric security analysis engine |
| `POST /api/execute` | Security scan and execute submitted Python or C++ code |
| `POST /api/save` | Save code as a separate fixed file or create a named file |
| `POST /api/upload` | Save an uploaded `.py` / `.cpp` file without executing it |
| `GET /api/suite-report` | Return structured suite benchmark report data |
| `GET /api/analytics` | Return eco/analytics dashboard data |
| `POST /api/analytics/refresh` | Refresh analytics metrics |
| `GET /api/sandbox/status` | Inspect active sandbox engine, isolation boundaries, and capabilities |

All code-accepting endpoints enforce a 100 KB input size limit.

